UnitCanonGuard::constructor
├── when passing valid parameters
│   ├── it sets safe address
│   ├── it sets multiSendCallOnly address
│   ├── it sets short execution delay
│   ├── it sets long execution delay
│   ├── it sets the parent
│   └── it set transaction expiry delay
├── when the transaction expiry delay is less than the minimum expiry time
│   └── it reverts
├── when the maximum approval duration is less than the minimum expiry time
│   └── it reverts
├── when the short execution delay is greater than the long execution delay
│   └── it reverts
├── when tx expiry delay is greater than max
│   └── it reverts
└── when long delay is greater than max
    └── it reverts

UnitCanonGuard::approveActionsBuilderOrHub
├── when caller is safe
│   ├── when approval duration is greater than max approval duration
│   │   └── it reverts with InvalidApprovalDuration
│   ├── it sets approval expiry time
│   ├── it emits ActionsBuilderOrHubApproved event
│   └── when extending approval
│       ├── it updates approval expiry time
│       └── it emits ActionsBuilderOrHubApproved event
└── when caller is not safe
    └── it reverts with NotSafeOwner

UnitCanonGuard::queueTransaction
├── when caller is safe owner
│   ├── when it has no parent
│   │   ├── when no parent action builder is pre approved
│   │   │   ├── it sets transaction info
│   │   │   ├── it adds the action builder to the queue
│   │   │   ├── it sets the proposer
│   │   │   ├── it sets executable time at block timestamp plus short delay
│   │   │   ├── it sets expiry time at executable time plus expiry delay
│   │   │   └── it emits TransactionQueued event
│   │   ├── when no parent action builder is not pre approved
│   │   │   ├── it sets transaction info
│   │   │   ├── it adds the action builder to the queue
│   │   │   ├── it sets the proposer
│   │   │   ├── it sets executable time at block timestamp plus long delay
│   │   │   ├── it sets expiry time at executable time plus expiry delay
│   │   │   └── it emits TransactionQueued event
│   │   ├── when no parent transaction is already queued but expired
│   │   │   ├── it sets transaction info
│   │   │   └── it does not re add the action builder to the queue
│   │   └── when no parent transaction is already queued and not expired
│   │       ├── it reverts with TransactionAlreadyQueued
│   │       └── it does not re add the action builder to the queue
│   ├── when parent is not a hub
│   │   ├── when transaction is already queued but expired
│   │   │   ├── it sets transaction info
│   │   │   └── it does not re add the action builder to the queue
│   │   ├── when transaction is already queued and not expired
│   │   │   └── it reverts with TransactionAlreadyQueued
│   │   ├── when action builder is pre approved
│   │   │   ├── it sets transaction info
│   │   │   ├── it adds the action builder to the queue
│   │   │   ├── it sets the proposer
│   │   │   ├── it sets executable time at block timestamp plus short delay
│   │   │   ├── it sets expiry time at executable time plus expiry delay
│   │   │   └── it emits TransactionQueued event
│   │   └── when action builder is not pre approved
│   │       ├── it sets transaction info
│   │       ├── it adds the action builder to the queue
│   │       ├── it sets the proposer
│   │       ├── it sets executable time at block timestamp plus long delay
│   │       ├── it sets expiry time at executable time plus expiry delay
│   │       └── it emits TransactionQueued event
│   └── when parent is a hub
│       ├── when hub transaction is already queued but expired
│       │   ├── it sets transaction info
│       │   └── it does not re add the action builder to the queue
│       ├── when hub transaction is already queued and not expired
│       │   ├── it reverts with TransactionAlreadyQueued
│       │   └── it does not re add the action builder to the queue
│       ├── when action builder is not a child of the hub
│       │   └── it reverts with InvalidActionBuilderHubParent
│       └── when action builder is a child of the hub
│           ├── when action hub is pre approved
│           │   ├── it sets transaction info
│           │   ├── it adds the action builder to the queue
│           │   ├── it sets the proposer
│           │   ├── it sets executable time at block timestamp plus short delay
│           │   ├── it sets expiry time at executable time plus expiry delay
│           │   └── it emits TransactionQueued event
│           └── when action hub is not pre approved
│               ├── it sets transaction info
│               ├── it adds the action builder to the queue
│               ├── it sets the proposer
│               ├── it sets executable time at block timestamp plus long delay
│               ├── it sets expiry time at executable time plus expiry delay
│               └── it emits TransactionQueued event
└── when caller is not safe owner
    └── it reverts with NotSafeOwner

UnitCanonGuard::executeTransaction
├── when in emergency mode and the caller is not the emergency caller
│   └── it reverts with Unauthorized
├── when transaction is expired
│   └── it reverts with TransactionExpired
├── when approved transaction is not yet executable
│   └── it reverts with TransactionNotYetExecutable
├── when transaction is not queued
│   └── it reverts with TransactionNotQueued
└── when approved transaction is valid
    ├── when in simulation mode
    │   ├── it executes transaction with CanonGuard as signer
    │   ├── it deletes transaction from mapping
    │   ├── it deletes transaction from queue
    │   └── it emits TransactionExecuted event
    └── when not in simulation mode
        ├── it executes transaction
        ├── it deletes transaction from mapping
        ├── it deletes transaction from queue
        └── it emits TransactionExecuted event

UnitCanonGuard::executeTransactions
├── when in emergency mode and the caller is not the emergency caller
│   └── it reverts with Unauthorized
├── when at least one transaction is expired
│   └── it reverts with TransactionExpired
├── when at least one approved transaction is not yet executable
│   └── it reverts with TransactionNotYetExecutable
├── when at least one transaction is not queued
│   └── it reverts with TransactionNotQueued
└── when all transactions are valid
    ├── when in simulation mode
    │   ├── it executes transactions with CanonGuard as signer
    │   ├── it delete transactions from mapping
    │   ├── it deletes transactions from queue
    │   └── it emits TransactionExecuted event
    └── when not in simulation mode
        ├── it executes transactions
        ├── it deletes transactions from mapping
        ├── it deletes transactions from queue
        └── it emits TransactionExecuted event

UnitCanonGuard::cancelEnqueuedTransaction
├── when emergency mode is active
│   ├── when the caller is not the emergency caller
│   │   └── it reverts with Unauthorized
│   ├── when the caller is the emergency caller and proposer
│   │   ├── it deletes transaction from queue
│   │   ├── it deletes transaction from mapping
│   │   └── it emits EnqueuedTransactionCancelled event
│   └── when the caller is the emergency caller and not the proposer
│       ├── it deletes transaction from queue
│       ├── it deletes transaction from mapping
│       └── it emits EnqueuedTransactionCancelled event
├── when transaction is not queued
│   └── it reverts with NoTransactionQueued
├── when caller is not the proposer
│   └── it reverts with CallerMustBeTransactionProposer
├── when transaction has approved hash signers
│   └── it reverts with TransactionWithSignaturesCannotBeCancelled
└── when transaction can be cancelled
    ├── it deletes transaction from queue
    ├── it deletes transaction from mapping
    └── it emits EnqueuedTransactionCancelled event

UnitCanonGuard::executeNoActionTransaction
├── when emergency mode is active
│   ├── when the caller is the emergency caller
│   │   ├── it executes transaction
│   │   └── it emits NoActionTransactionExecuted event
│   └── when the caller is not the emergency caller
│       └── it reverts with Unauthorized
└── when emergency mode is not active
    ├── it executes transaction
    └── it emits NoActionTransactionExecuted event

UnitCanonGuard::getSafeTransactionHash
├── when the address is the zero address
│   └── it returns correct hash
└── when the address is not the zero address
    ├── when transaction exists
    │   ├── it returns correct hash
    │   └── when getting hash with nonce
    │       └── it returns correct hash
    └── when transaction does not exist
        └── it reverts with NoTransactionQueued

UnitCanonGuard::getApprovedHashSigners
├── when the address is the zero address
│   └── it returns approved signers for empty transaction
└── when the address is not the zero address
    ├── when transaction exists
    │   └── it returns approved signers
    └── when transaction does not exist
        └── it reverts with NoTransactionQueued

UnitCanonGuard::getSafeNonce
└── it returns correct nonce

UnitCanonGuard::getQueuedActionBuilders
├── when there are action builders in the queue
│   └── it returns the action builders in the queue
└── when there are no action builders in the queue
    └── it returns an empty array
